Andy Johnson wrote on Sun, 31 Jul 2005 21:19:06 -0700:
> Are /oW really that rare? 

One out of 200, according to Dylan's spoiler.  (This excludes wands 
generated in monster inventories).  There are a good deal of wands lying 
about the dungeon and shops, or stuffed in chests, and always four in 
Sokoban.  So if you play enough long-ish games, you'll probably find one 
sooner rather than later.

(I've found two in my last ten games, in shops on Dl3 and DL4.)

